 commands and telemetry. Controller automation and physical filtration belong in Flowchart 02." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#193A4B;fontSize=22;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="1981" width="1900" height="65" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="foot2" value="Filter life uses measured runtime and sensor data with a model trained on generated data. Missing measurements show a waiting state." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#193A4B;fontSize=22;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="2015" width="1900" height="65" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>